    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: cf5339d339411bbdc6affa1744d95e510ac13e21 -->\n**Verdict: Ready for the maintainer to merge** (delta review)\n\nDelta review of the merge(s) since the last reviewed head `72f2c72`; current head `cf5339d`. Only merge-of-main commits were added, no new own code.\n\n**Checked**\n- Merge cf5339d3 (of #624's branch, which carries the main merge a5756b59, into this one): `posting.rs` MACHINES and `tests/machine.rs` keep main's #618 M+ rows, #624's 8L / 15L rows and this PR's 15LX row; nothing dropped. Stacked on #624, which needs to merge first.\n- `gh pr diff 627 --name-only` lists only this PR's own files; no snapshot PNG, CHANGELOG.md or RECOMMENDED.md edits.\n- Trial merge with current origin/main (`4827fde6`): already up to date, no conflicts, GitHub reports MERGEABLE.\n\n**Local results (merged with main)**\n- machine 32 passed, machine_library 11, tormach_machines 6, tormach_lathes 2, tormach_safe_retract 4: all ok\n- clippy (lib + those test targets, -D warnings): clean\n\nNote: `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets` fails on main itself (`crates/app/tests/lathe_thread_travel.rs:83` misses the `hand` field of `OpParams::Threading`); that file is untouched by this PR, so clippy was run on the lib plus the touched test targets instead (clean, `-D warnings`). Worth a separate fix on main.\n\nA maintainer will approve and merge by hand.\n",
